Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:00:51 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 47/78] PlaitOS: adapt QS tile layout to GrapheneOS

The column and row counts read plain Settings.System plait_qs_tiles_* and
plait_qqs_tiles_* keys (PlaitQsLayoutSettings) instead of new Settings API
constants; unset = the stock resource values.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WNZzm3ssZ7eH5QDg4P9AiP
